.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135468844,imgsize-176190.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Entire police force resigns in Georgia city; Mayor Craig Timmons admits tracking police chief's truck]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135468284.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A small Georgia city is facing a police staffing crisis after its entire full-time police force resigned. Mayor Craig Timmons admitted placing a GPS tracker on Police Chief Lamar Bunn's truck over concerns about his timesheets. Bunn has denied wrongdoing, while the mass resignations have left the city relying on the county sheriff's office for police coverage.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/entire-full-time-police-force-resigns-in-georgia-city-mayor-craig-timmons-admits-placing-gps-tracker-on-milner-police-chiefs-truck-over-timesheet-concerns-lamar-bunn-denies-wrongdoing/articleshow/135468284.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/entire-full-time-police-force-resigns-in-georgia-city-mayor-craig-timmons-admits-placing-gps-tracker-on-milner-police-chiefs-truck-over-timesheet-concerns-lamar-bunn-denies-wrongdoing/articleshow/135468284.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T22:33:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135468585,imgsize-127276.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Historic Mansion Sale Soars: Nantucket’s Hadwen-Wright House fetches $15.25 million; hidden cistern preserved]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135444567.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Hadwen-Wright House in Nantucket fetched an impressive $15.25 million, after being originally listed at $15.5 million. This stunning mansion, a prime example of Greek Revival architecture, is steeped in history. Its extensive renovations not only maintained original features but also unveiled a unique brick-lined cistern now preserved for guests. This sale highlights the lasting appeal of Nantucket's historically significant residences.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2014-a-buyer-paid-4-7-million-for-an-1845-nantucket-mansion-following-restoration-work-the-home-with-two-domes-and-a-hidden-cistern-has-sold-for-15-25-million/articleshow/135444567.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2014-a-buyer-paid-4-7-million-for-an-1845-nantucket-mansion-following-restoration-work-the-home-with-two-domes-and-a-hidden-cistern-has-sold-for-15-25-million/articleshow/135444567.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T22:33:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135444668,imgsize-1819821.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 2013, divers started placing simple cinder-block pyramids on a Caribbean seabed]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135433416.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Initiated in 2013, the Grenada Artificial Reef Project employs concrete blocks to foster marine life habitats. Remarkable progress was observed shortly after, with algae and various invertebrates flourishing on the structures. However, while research shows these artificial reefs attract species typical of natural environments, further studies are essential to evaluate their role in aiding natural reef recovery and assessing their long-term effects on adjacent ecosystems.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/in-2013-divers-started-placing-simple-cinder-block-pyramids-on-a-caribbean-seabed-by-2025-100-pyramids-had-been-installed-with-the-grenada-project-reporting-over-30-fish-species-and-15-kinds-of-coral/articleshow/135433416.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/in-2013-divers-started-placing-simple-cinder-block-pyramids-on-a-caribbean-seabed-by-2025-100-pyramids-had-been-installed-with-the-grenada-project-reporting-over-30-fish-species-and-15-kinds-of-coral/articleshow/135433416.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T22:33:22+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135433416,imgsize-441652.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US judge dismisses charges against 2 ex-FBI officials over Hunter Biden laptop probe, calls prosecution 'weaponisation']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135467730.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-judge-dismisses-charges-against-2-ex-fbi-officials-over-hunter-biden-laptop-probe-calls-prosecution-weaponisation/articleshow/135467730.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-judge-dismisses-charges-against-2-ex-fbi-officials-over-hunter-biden-laptop-probe-calls-prosecution-weaponisation/articleshow/135467730.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T22:18:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Gokul Ankari</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135468067,imgsize-1186085.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Iran's supreme leader gave government 'certain authorities' over peace talks with US: Pezeshkian]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135467379.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/irans-supreme-leader-gave-government-certain-authorities-over-peace-talks-with-us-pezeshkian/articleshow/135467379.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/irans-supreme-leader-gave-government-certain-authorities-over-peace-talks-with-us-pezeshkian/articleshow/135467379.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T22:15:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kanchan Yadav</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135468296,imgsize-77803.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US midterms: Five flashpoints election officials are watching as America votes]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135467367.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-midterms-five-flashpoints-election-officials-are-watching-as-america-votes/articleshow/135467367.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-midterms-five-flashpoints-election-officials-are-watching-as-america-votes/articleshow/135467367.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T21:47:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135467458,imgsize-133944.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet the couple who couldn't afford a UK home bought an entire French hamlet for £26K, saved £100K]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135466565.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Yip Ward and Paul Mappley went from living in a caravan in England to owning an abandoned French hamlet. The couple bought the property for £26,000, which includes seven cottages, two barns and other buildings. By carrying out much of the restoration themselves, they estimate they have saved more than £100,000 while bringing the historic hamlet back to life.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/meet-yip-ward-and-paul-mappley-couple-who-couldnt-afford-a-uk-home-buy-french-hamlet-for-26000-with-seven-cottages-two-barns-and-more-save-over-100000-by-renovating-themselves/articleshow/135466565.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/meet-yip-ward-and-paul-mappley-couple-who-couldnt-afford-a-uk-home-buy-french-hamlet-for-26000-with-seven-cottages-two-barns-and-more-save-over-100000-by-renovating-themselves/articleshow/135466565.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T21:13:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135466706,imgsize-151538.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[NZ couple turn hillside land into a medieval brick castle with towers and a secret dungeon trapdoor]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135465363.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[After three decades of craftsmanship, Denise and Greg Powell are parting ways with their extraordinary recycled-brick castle in Broad Bay. What began as a straightforward home evolved into a medieval masterpiece, complete with a secret trapdoor and various salvaged architectural details. As they downsize to a cozier residence nearby, this unique property has seen its value soar since their acquisition in the early 90s.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-new-zealand-couple-bought-13-hectares-of-land-for-nz122500-in-1992-and-found-giant-old-church-doors-three-decades-later-their-recycled-brick-castle-has-towers-battlements-and-a-secret-dungeon-trapdoor/articleshow/135465363.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-new-zealand-couple-bought-13-hectares-of-land-for-nz122500-in-1992-and-found-giant-old-church-doors-three-decades-later-their-recycled-brick-castle-has-towers-battlements-and-a-secret-dungeon-trapdoor/articleshow/135465363.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T20:43:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135466150,imgsize-1300459.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[New Hampshire closed 20 acres of Great Bay to shellfish harvesting for 5 years from November 1]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135433911.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Fish and Game Department of New Hampshire has initiated a five-year period of closure at Great Bay to facilitate oyster restoration efforts. This move affects two key sites, one near Woodman Point and another near Nannie Island. Significant measures are being implemented to combat the alarming 90% decline in oyster reefs since 1970, involving collaboration between researchers and conservation groups to rejuvenate oyster populations and restore essential marine habitats.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/new-hampshire-has-closed-20-acres-of-great-bay-to-shellfish-harvesting-for-five-years-starting-november-1-protecting-two-oyster-restoration-sites-as-scientists-work-to-rebuild-reef-habitat-near-nannie-island/articleshow/135433911.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/new-hampshire-has-closed-20-acres-of-great-bay-to-shellfish-harvesting-for-five-years-starting-november-1-protecting-two-oyster-restoration-sites-as-scientists-work-to-rebuild-reef-habitat-near-nannie-island/articleshow/135433911.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T20:28:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135433911,imgsize-58328.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[New York volunteers spent seven years preparing six 175-pound reef balls for Eastchester Bay]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135434091.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[After years of meticulous planning, volunteers from City Island Oyster Reef successfully installed six reef balls in Eastchester Bay. These structures were intentionally seeded with oyster larvae to bolster local oyster populations. This initiative stems from thorough monitoring of both water quality and the ecosystem around City Island. Remarkably, marine species like fish and crabs have started to thrive in the area.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/new-york-volunteers-spent-seven-years-preparing-six-175-pound-reef-balls-for-eastchester-bay-weeks-after-the-october-2026-installation-divers-spotted-fish-crabs-and-shrimp-sheltering-among-oyster-covered-structures/articleshow/135434091.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/new-york-volunteers-spent-seven-years-preparing-six-175-pound-reef-balls-for-eastchester-bay-weeks-after-the-october-2026-installation-divers-spotted-fish-crabs-and-shrimp-sheltering-among-oyster-covered-structures/articleshow/135434091.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T20:28:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135434091,imgsize-262012.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Look outside, Jack!' Who was the man called out by female pilot Nathalia in final moments of Learjet crash?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135467034.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/look-outside-jack-who-was-the-man-called-out-by-female-pilot-nathalia-in-final-moments-of-learjet-crash/articleshow/135467034.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/look-outside-jack-who-was-the-man-called-out-by-female-pilot-nathalia-in-final-moments-of-learjet-crash/articleshow/135467034.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T21:29:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135467074,imgsize-76668.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Russia exits European anti-torture treaty, ends independent prison inspections]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135465367.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/russia-exits-european-anti-torture-treaty-ends-independent-prison-inspections/articleshow/135465367.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/russia-exits-european-anti-torture-treaty-ends-independent-prison-inspections/articleshow/135465367.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-02T20:09:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135465532,imgsize-21472.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Co-pilot of doomed Learjet flight that crashed in Florida identified as Nathalia Gadelha. She got her private pilot's license when she was 17]]></title><description><![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/